msgstr "主題色"

msgid "Library"
msgstr "桌布庫"

msgid "Steam Workshop"
msgstr "Steam 工作坊"

msgid "Preferences"
msgstr "偏好設定"

msgid "Search wallpapers"
msgstr "搜尋桌布"

msgid "Refresh"
msgstr "重新整理"


msgid "Load more"
msgstr "載入更多"

msgid "Details"
msgstr "詳細資訊"

msgid "Search the Workshop"
msgstr "搜尋工作坊"

msgid "Adjust playback, volume and when to pause."
msgstr "調整播放、音量與暫停時機。"

msgid "%s wallpapers"
msgstr "%s 張"

msgid "No wallpapers here yet"
msgstr "這裡還沒有桌布"

msgid "Install Wallpaper Engine in Steam, then subscribe to wallpapers in the Workshop; they show up here once Steam has downloaded them."
msgstr "在 Steam 安裝 Wallpaper Engine，然後到工作坊訂閱桌布；Steam 下載完成後會出現在這裡。"

msgid "Install Wallpaper Engine"
msgstr "安裝 Wallpaper Engine"

msgid "Select a wallpaper to see its details."
msgstr "選一張桌布來查看詳細資訊。"

msgid "Could not load the Workshop"
msgstr "無法載入工作坊"

msgid "Retry"
msgstr "重試"

msgid "No matching wallpapers"
msgstr "找不到符合的桌布"

msgid "Try another keyword or tag."
msgstr "換個關鍵字或標籤試試。"

msgid "%s subscribers"
msgstr "%s 人訂閱"

msgid "In use"
msgstr "使用中"

msgid "Not supported"
msgstr "無法顯示"

msgid "Local wallpaper"
msgstr "本機桌布"

msgid "%s ratings"
msgstr "%s 則評價"

msgid "Cannot be applied"
msgstr "無法套用"

msgid "This scene uses a 3D perspective camera, which the scene renderer cannot show yet."
msgstr "這張場景使用 3D 透視攝影機，目前的場景渲染器還無法顯示。"

msgid "Stop wallpaper"
msgstr "停止桌布"

msgid "Apply wallpaper"
msgstr "套用桌布"

msgid "Subscribe in Steam (%s)"
msgstr "在 Steam 訂閱（%s）"

msgid "Opened in Steam: press Subscribe there and it downloads automatically."
msgstr "已在 Steam 開啟這張桌布，按下「訂閱」後會自動下載。"

msgid "Subscribing goes through your Steam account; the wallpaper appears in the library once it is downloaded."
msgstr "訂閱會透過你的 Steam 帳號進行；下載完成後自動出現在桌布庫。"

msgid "Open Workshop page in Steam"
msgstr "在 Steam 開啟工作坊頁面"

msgid "About this wallpaper"
msgstr "作品資訊"

msgid "Subscribers"
msgstr "訂閱人數"

msgid "Favorites"
msgstr "收藏人數"

msgid "Updated"
msgstr "更新日期"

msgid "Tags"
msgstr "標籤"

msgid "Description"
msgstr "作者說明"

msgid "Options"
msgstr "自訂選項"

msgid "%s options"
msgstr "%s 項"

msgid "Show all %s options"
msgstr "顯示全部 %s 項"

msgid "No live wallpaper applied"
msgstr "未套用動態桌布"

msgid "Paused"
msgstr "已暫停"

msgid "Playing"
msgstr "播放中"

msgid "Resume"
msgstr "繼續播放"

msgid "Pause"
msgstr "暫停"

msgid "Unmute"
msgstr "取消靜音"

msgid "Mute"
msgstr "靜音"

msgid "Playback"
msgstr "播放"

msgid "Mute wallpaper audio"
msgstr "桌布靜音"

msgid "Volume"
msgstr "音量"

msgid "Scaling"
msgstr "縮放方式"

msgid "Pause automatically"
msgstr "自動暫停"

msgid "Show on the lock screen"
msgstr "鎖定畫面也顯示桌布"

msgid "When off, playback pauses while the screen is locked"
msgstr "關閉時，鎖定期間會暫停播放"

msgid "Other wallpaper folders"
msgstr "其他桌布資料夾"

msgid "Each sub-folder is one wallpaper (with a project.json). Steam libraries are found automatically."
msgstr "資料夾內每個子資料夾是一張桌布（含 project.json）。Steam 收藏庫會自動找到，不必加入。"

msgid "Add folder"
msgstr "加入資料夾"

msgid "Choose a wallpaper folder"
msgstr "選擇桌布資料夾"

msgid "Remove"
msgstr "移除"

msgid "No wallpaper project found in %s"
msgstr "在 %s 找不到桌布專案"

msgid "“%s” is a “%s” wallpaper, which is not supported"
msgstr "「%s」是「%s」類型的桌布，目前不支援"

msgid "Could not start the wallpaper renderer: %s"
msgstr "無法啟動桌布渲染器：%s"


msgid "Scene wallpapers need Wallpaper Engine itself to be installed in Steam (for its assets folder)."
msgstr "場景桌布需要先在 Steam 安裝 Wallpaper Engine 本體（會用到它的 assets 資料夾）。"

msgid "The wallpaper renderer keeps crashing; giving up on this wallpaper."
msgstr "桌布渲染器不斷當掉，已停止嘗試這張桌布。"

msgid "System default"
msgstr "系統預設"

msgid "Interface"
msgstr "介面"

msgid "Language"
msgstr "語言"

msgid "Takes effect the next time this window is opened"
msgstr "下次開啟這個視窗時生效"

msgid "Playlist"
msgstr "播放清單"

msgid "Remove from playlist"
msgstr "從播放清單移除"

msgid "Add to playlist"
msgstr "加入播放清單"

msgid "Add wallpapers to the playlist from their details, then let them rotate."
msgstr "在桌布的詳細資訊裡加入播放清單，就能定時輪播。"

msgid "Change wallpaper every"
msgstr "每隔多久換一張桌布"

msgid "Minutes; 0 turns rotation off"
msgstr "單位為分鐘；0 表示不輪播"

msgid "Shuffle"
msgstr "隨機順序"

msgid "Apply to %s only"
msgstr "只套用到 %s"

msgid "Still image as desktop background"
msgstr "以靜態畫面作為系統桌布"

msgid "Shown while the live wallpaper is not running"
msgstr "動態桌布未執行時顯示"

msgid "Windows behind the Dock"
msgstr "Dock 後方顯示視窗"

msgid "Windows behind the top bar"
msgstr "頂端列後方顯示視窗"

msgid "Scene wallpapers need the scene renderer"
msgstr "場景桌布需要場景渲染器"

msgid "Install"
msgstr "安裝"

msgid "Install the scene renderer?"
msgstr "安裝場景渲染器？"

msgid "Downloads about 1 GB and builds for a few minutes. Nothing is installed system-wide."
msgstr "將下載約 1 GB 並建置數分鐘，不會安裝到系統目錄。"

msgid "Cancel"
msgstr "取消"

msgid "Installing the scene renderer"
msgstr "正在安裝場景渲染器"

msgid "The scene renderer could not be installed"
msgstr "無法安裝場景渲染器"

msgid "Show log"
msgstr "顯示記錄"

msgid "Scene wallpapers need the scene renderer. Install it from the Paper Engine window."
msgstr "場景桌布需要場景渲染器，請在 Paper Engine 視窗中安裝。"
